<BaseLayout title="Our Coaches" description="Meet the Sentinels Soccer Club coaching staff serving Morgan Hill, Gilroy, and Hollister — collegiate athletes and licensed trainers focused on player development.">
<h1 class="vh">Sentinels Soccer Club Coaching Staff â€” Morgan Hill, Gilroy, and Hollister</h1>

